1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,636
Operation Epic Fury

2
00:00:03,636 --> 00:00:33,440
At 3:38 p.m. Eastern time on February 27, President Trump ordered Operation Epic Fury to go. Through January and February the United States had massed its largest force in the Middle East since the 2003 invasion of Iraq. Nuclear talks ran all through February. The ships kept arriving while the table was still open. Someone in Tehran must have believed it was a show of force to win at the table. That belief was wrong.

3
00:00:34,040 --> 00:01:06,796
At 9:45 a.m. on February 28, America’s Epic Fury and Israel’s Roaring Lion began at the same moment. Tomahawks, B-2 bombers, and about 200 Israeli fighter jets struck the Revolutionary Guards’ command sites, air defenses, and missile bases. Explosions ran through Tehran, Qom, Kermanshah, Isfahan, and Karaj. Israel said that in the first 24 hours it used more than 1,200 bombs on 500 military targets.

4
00:01:07,396 --> 00:01:33,984
At 10:15 a.m. the Israeli Air Force struck the Supreme Leader’s residential compound in Tehran. Three meetings were underway beneath that roof. Ali Khamenei and the top military command were killed. That same morning the Iranian prayer-time app BadeSaba was hacked, and one alert went out to every phone: Help has arrived. The Iranian government did not confirm the death until March 1.

5
00:01:34,584 --> 00:01:59,732
That same morning a missile hit the Shajareh Tayyebeh girls’ elementary school in Minab, in southern Iran. Iranian media reported 180 dead. Most of them were children. The Iranian Red Crescent said more than 200 people died on the first day of the war. Attributed to a U.S. Tomahawk, the strike became the single deadliest loss of civilian life in the war.

6
00:02:00,332 --> 00:02:31,744
At 12:35 p.m. Iran launched its retaliation, True Promise IV. At 12:56 a U.S. Fifth Fleet facility in Bahrain was hit, and impacts in Israel were confirmed at 1:45 p.m. The attacks spread to Kuwait, Abu Dhabi, Dubai, Riyadh, and Erbil in Iraq. The Revolutionary Guards said they had aimed at Al Udeid in Qatar, Al Dhafra in the UAE, and Fifth Fleet headquarters in Bahrain.

7
00:02:32,344 --> 00:02:35,892
Epic Fury continues in Episode 2.
